John Smith is customer ID C1001. His line L1002 is active with 8.7/15 GB data used, and it has roaming_enabled: false. He is in France (roaming), and MMS requires data. Since roaming is disabled on the line, the device likely isn’t getting data while abroad, which blocks MMS. This prevents the issue from being fixed with standard roaming settings toggles on the device side because the line’s service settings (roaming disabled) block data connectivity abroad.

Thus, this requires escalation to a human agent to enable roaming on the line or discuss data/roaming plan changes. I will escalate now.

